              "title": "Configuration library custody",
              "text": "The Borrower shall keep all material customer-deployment templates, workflow schemas, and connector mappings owned by a Loan Party or stored in a repository subject to the Lender's collateral lien. The Borrower may grant customers ordinary-course use rights and may use third-party hosted repositories if a Loan Party retains export rights and administrative control. Any sale, exclusive license, transfer, or repository migration that leaves a non-Loan Party with sole export authority over a material configuration library requires the Lender's prior written consent. A prohibited transfer violates this covenant immediately upon execution, regardless of later restoration of access."
