          "text": "Section 6.02 Certificates; Other Information. Deliver to the Administrative Agent for prompt further distribution to each Lender:\n\n(a) together with the delivery of the financial statements referred to in Section 6.01(a) and (b), a duly completed Compliance Certificate signed by a Responsible Officer of the Borrower;"
